@startuml
title La Nonna - gateway, identidad y políticas
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
left to right direction

actor "Visitante" as guest
actor "Cliente autenticado" as client
actor "Administrador" as admin
class ApiGateway {
  +dispatch(method, path)
  +authenticate(bearer)
  +rateLimit(client)
}
class RouteDefinition {
  +method
  +pathPattern
  +accessPolicy
  +serviceTarget
}
class AuthenticationPolicy {
  +validateSession(token)
  +signVerifiedIdentity(claims)
}
class AuthorizationPolicy {
  +requireRole(role)
  +requireOwnership(resource, user)
}
class ServiceTarget {
  +baseUrl
  +timeout
  +forward(request)
}
class SecretProvider {
  +internalServiceToken
  +identitySigningSecret
}
class AuthService {
  +login(credentials)
  +introspect(token)
  +revoke(token)
}
class GraphQLGateway {
  +execute(query, identity)
  +enforceQueryLimits()
}
class Resolver {
  +resolveMenu()
  +resolveOrders(identity)
}
class InventoryService {
  +getProducts()
  +reserveStock(items)
}
class OrdersService {
  +createOrder(identity, items)
  +getOrders(identity)
}
class PaymentsService {
  +createPayment(identity, order)
  +verifyWebhook(signature, event)
}
database "DB por dominio\nsin acceso cruzado" as databases

ApiGateway "1" *-- "1..*" RouteDefinition
ApiGateway --> AuthenticationPolicy
ApiGateway --> AuthorizationPolicy
ApiGateway --> SecretProvider
ApiGateway --> AuthService
ApiGateway "1" --> "1..*" ServiceTarget
GraphQLGateway "1" *-- "1..*" Resolver
GraphQLGateway --> ServiceTarget
Resolver --> InventoryService
Resolver --> OrdersService
OrdersService --> InventoryService : API interna\nreservar/liberar
PaymentsService --> OrdersService : API interna\nvalidar/confirmar
AuthService --> databases
InventoryService --> databases
OrdersService --> databases
PaymentsService --> databases

guest --> ApiGateway : rutas públicas permitidas
client --> ApiGateway : Bearer token
admin --> ApiGateway : Bearer + rol admin

note right of ApiGateway
Lista explícita por método y ruta.
Rate limit general y de login.
Cabeceras de identidad del navegador
se descartan; contexto verificado se firma.
end note
note bottom of SecretProvider
Referencias de entorno:
INTERNAL_SERVICE_TOKEN
IDENTITY_SIGNING_SECRET
WEBPAY_WEBHOOK_SECRET
Valores reales fuera del repositorio;
Vault/rotación automática pendientes.
end note
note bottom of AuthorizationPolicy
Gateway autoriza ruta/rol.
Cada servicio vuelve a comprobar firma,
rol y propiedad del recurso.
end note
@enduml
